WEBVTT

00:03.220 --> 00:07.582
Thank you. We're going to slow things down for

00:07.622 --> 00:08.622
you for just a minute.

00:17.605 --> 00:21.767
The streetlights make a blurry line.

00:25.068 --> 00:27.469
I'm running through the same old signs.

00:33.020 --> 00:36.383
I'm just a face in a passing crowd

00:39.045 --> 00:44.429
Afraid to speak my thoughts out loud

00:47.371 --> 00:51.934
But then you found me in the noise

00:54.756 --> 00:59.200
You heard a whisper in my voice

01:02.616 --> 01:06.741
You gave me something to believe,

01:08.703 --> 01:10.685
a reason I wouldn't

01:15.837 --> 01:23.544
If you walked away, the sky would lose its blue. I

01:23.624 --> 01:30.289
wouldn't know what to do. I'd be lost in the gray.

01:30.630 --> 01:39.097
If you walked away, my world would fall apart.

01:57.572 --> 02:02.117
They build these walls so high and steep

02:04.920 --> 02:09.204
With promises they never keep

02:12.668 --> 02:16.112
But we have a fortress, strong and true

02:18.823 --> 02:29.246
I'm safe as long as I have you. If you walked away,

02:29.326 --> 02:35.127
the sky would lose its blue. I wouldn't know what

02:35.187 --> 02:44.190
to do. I'd be lost in the gray. If you walked away,

02:44.590 --> 02:48.491
my world would fall apart.

02:51.153 --> 02:59.978
You're the owner of my neon heart

03:02.179 --> 03:08.743
I'm holding on, I'm

03:09.303 --> 03:13.445
holding tight Don't let me go into the night

03:19.603 --> 03:27.286
If you walked away The sky would lose its blue I

03:27.366 --> 03:34.448
wouldn't know what to do I'd be lost in the gray If

03:34.488 --> 03:43.412
you walked away My world would fall apart

03:44.812 --> 03:47.233
You're the owner of my heart

04:00.945 --> 04:06.156
Don't walk away Thank

04:06.196 --> 04:06.977
you so much

